    sum += i;
} And if I use OpenMP to speed up it, how is this for loop mapped to 4 different cores? I know it uses fork and join, I mean is it like i=0 for core 0, i=1 for core 1 and etc or i=0 for core 0, i=249 for core 1, i = 499 for core 2 etc. Thanks, Bob

I have the following code: #pragma omp parallel shared(a,n) private(i,j,k,x,pid,rows,mymin,mymax)
